  "limits": [
    "One assigned local controller and six gameplay actions; no general action maps, local multiplayer routing, rumble, gyro or controller menu navigation yet.",
    "SDL host qualified with virtual joysticks and actual SDL event queues on Windows; physical controllers, Bluetooth, latency and controller feel remain unqualified.",
    "Windows player lifecycle uses targeted synthetic Win32 input. Replays use semantic input and do not qualify physical gamepad control in a rendered session.",
    "Existing v1 profile serialization/hash/receipts preserved. v2 conversion requires a new file; in-place format conversion is rejected.",
    "Profiles apply before play; world-service transport still blocks during runtime.play.",
    "Neutral gate uses the smaller inner deadzone for both physical sticks, including unused sticks. Zero deadzone requires exact centering.",
    "Triggers map to digital actions with hysteresis; arbitrary analog gameplay actions are not yet exposed.",
    "Native Linux graphics and console SDK integrations remain unqualified.",
    "Full settings and public game-save serialization are separate unfinished milestones."
  ],
